OL,3,GNEWSA'Early release' prisoners back in
OL,4,Ajail, say police
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree people are back behind bars after
OL,7,Fbeing arrested by Humberside Police
OL,8,Fdays after leaving prison under the
OL,9,Fgovernment's early release scheme, the
OL,10,FBBC has learnt.
OL,12,FThe woman and two men were arrested for
OL,13,Foffences including burglary, drunk and
OL,14,Fdisorderly and fraud by false
OL,15,Frepresentation, the force confirmed.
OL,17,FHumberside Police confirmed all three
OL,18,Foffenders were now back in prison.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
