OL,3,GNEWSA'Early release' prisoners back in
OL,4,Ajail, say police
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey were among around 700 prisoners
OL,7,Ffrom across the country who were
OL,8,Freleased from custody early on 1
OL,9,FOctober in a bid to tackle prison
OL,10,Fovercrowding. Seventy-four of them were
OL,11,Freleased into the Humberside Police
OL,12,Farea.
